<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-No need to amend foreign media rules-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-No need to amend foreign media rules-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday he saw no immediate need to revise the government's foreign ownership rules regarding the media.</p>
<p>&quot;Our foreign investment policy in the media continues the policy which has been put in place over a long period of time and we don't see any immediate reason to change that,&quot; Costello told reporters.</p>
<p>He was asked if there was any chance of the government expanding its inquiry into the cross media ownership rules to include foreign ownership issues.</p>
</text>
